{"id":"wb-5-350","name":"慈胜寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"慈胜寺 (温县)","text":"慈胜寺是一座位于河南省焦作市温县西番田镇大吴村的佛教寺庙。最早建设于唐代贞观年间。北宋末期因战乱被毁，元代重修。现存建筑多为元代遗存。2001年6月25日，慈胜寺被中华人民共和国国务院列为第五批全国重点文化保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%85%88%E8%83%9C%E5%AF%BA_(%E6%B8%A9%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":86856380,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856380","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2de79f30c54aa73b36b6c15f.jpg","title":"20240824_Cisheng_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240824_Cisheng_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/20240824_Cisheng_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Cisheng Temple in Wen County","width":320,"height":213}}